        "content": "<p>The AI for Math fund announcement is out now: <a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/news-and-insights/ai-for-math-fund-announces-18-million-in-grants-to-accelerate-breakthrough-discoveries-in-mathematicsnbsp\">https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/news-and-insights/ai-for-math-fund-announces-18-million-in-grants-to-accelerate-breakthrough-discoveries-in-mathematicsnbsp</a></p>\n<p>Congratulations to all the recipients, and in particular those (mentioning) using Lean, whether active here on the Zulip or not:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/towards-automated-mathematical-discovery\">Towards Automated Mathematical Discovery</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"248811\">@Navin Goyal</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/sketchpad-a-high-precision-and-easy-to-use-system-for-automatic-formal-sketch-generation\">Sketchpad</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"375390\">@Wenda Li</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"131965\">@Lawrence Paulson</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"481527\">@Huajian Xin</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/scalable-theorem-proving\">Scalable Theorem Proving via Mathematical Databases</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"389019\">@Chris Birkbeck</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"814085\">@David Roe</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"320522\">@Andrew Sutherland</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/mathbench-towards-evaluating-natural-language-proofs\">Mathbench</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"130575\">@Siddharth Bhat</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"896469\">@Pawan sasanka ammanamanchi</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/leaning-and-rocqing\">Leaning and Rocq'ing</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110193\">@Cyril Cohen</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"930585\">@Marc Lelarge</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/leantutor-a-tutor-for-undergraduate-mathematics-proofs\">LeanTutor</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"933027\">@Gireeja Ranade</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"521331\">@Niels Voss</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"927229\">@Manooshree Patel</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/leanaid-bridgingai-and-mathematics-with-autoformalization\">LeanAide</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"266304\">@Siddhartha Gadgil</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"703393\">@Anirudh Gupta</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"693485\">@Mrigank Pawagi</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"887935\">@Swarnava Chakraborty</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"557243\">@Shubham Kumar 🦀 (he/him)</span>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/gnn-smt-consortium-based-proof-automation-for-lean-4\">GNN-SMT</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"934082\">@Clark Barrett</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"599027\">@Leni Aniva</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"417967\">@Abdalrhman M Mohamed</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"265538\">@Harun Khan</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/game-over-or-qed\">Game Over or QED?</a> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"507231\">@Marcus Zibrowius</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/domain-specific-documentation-for-mathlib-1\">Domain Specific Documentation for Mathlib</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"506168\">@John Talbot</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"424936\">@Richard Hill</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/document-level-autoformalization\">Document-Level Autoformalization</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"946644\">@Viktor Kunčak</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"724957\">@Maryna Viazovska</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/databases-of-structured-motivated-proofs\">Databases of Structured Motivated Proofs</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"303675\">@Anand Rao Tadipatri</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"420256\">@AG</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"722013\">@Jacob Loader</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"479299\">@Jovan Gerbscheid</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"605003\">@Jonas Bayer</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/constraining-llms-for-theorem-proving-a-neurosymbolic-approach-to-guaranteed-autoformalization\">Constraining LLMs for Theorem Proving</a> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/bridging-proof-and-computation-a-verified-leanmacaulay2-interface\">Bridging Proof and Computation</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"306577\">@Matthew Ballard</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"888611\">@Anton L.</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"321459\">@Damiano Testa</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"888613\">@Michael Stillman</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/a-structured-representation-of-tactics-for-machine-assisted-theorem-proving\">A Structured Representation of Tactics for Machine-Assisted Theorem Proving</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"760612\">@Bruno Gavranović</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"243909\">@André Videla</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/a-dataset-of-modern-formalized-theorem-statements\">A Dataset of Modern Formalized Theorem Statements</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110038\">@Kevin Buzzard</span> </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org/an-ai-focused-tractic-for-languag-learning-1\">An AI-Focused Tactic for Language Learning</a> <span aria-label=\"wave\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44b\" role=\"img\" title=\"wave\">:wave:</span> <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110596\">@Rob Lewis</span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>There are many other great projects funded in this round --- if you know one of those is going to be using Lean but wasn't mentioned here, let me know and I'll add it to the list. </p>\n<p>I'm really looking forward to the databases, libraries, and especially <em>user tools</em> coming out of these projects in the months to come. Please tell us more about your plans! (Either in the <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/AI.20for.20Math.20fund.20projects/with/539996824\">discussion thread</a> for this post, or in a dedicated thread.)</p>\n<p>And finally thanks to XTX Markets as the founding donor, and RenPhil for running the program!</p>",
